{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0042-trapping-rain-water","title":"LeetCode 42 接雨水","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0042-trapping-rain-water","wordCount":798,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-42-接雨水\">LeetCode 42 接雨水</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定 <code>n</code> 个非负整数表示每个宽度为 1 的柱子的高度图，计算按此排列的柱子，下雨之后能接多少雨水。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：height = [0,1,0,2,1,0,1,3,2,1,2,1]&#10;输出：6&#10;解释：&#10;  柱状图如下，阴影部分表示可以接的雨水：&#10;&#10;       █&#10;   █   ██ █&#10;  _█ █ ████ █&#10;  上方可以接住 6 个单位的雨水&#10;&#10;输入：height = [4,2,0,3,2,5]&#10;输出：9\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：height = [0,1,0,2,1,0,1,3,2,1,2,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  柱状图如下，阴影部分表示可以接的雨水：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       █</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   █   ██ █</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  _█ █ ████ █</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  上方可以接住 6 个单位的雨水</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：height = [4,2,0,3,2,5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：9</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>n == height.length</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 2 × 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= height[i] &lt;= 10⁵</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>接雨水是面试高频经典题，有多种解法，每种体现不同的算法思想。</p>\n<p><strong>核心公式：</strong> 位置 <code>i</code> 能接的雨水量 = <code>min(leftMax[i], rightMax[i]) - height[i]</code>。其中 <code>leftMax[i]</code> 是 <code>i</code> 左侧（含自身）最高的柱子高度，<code>rightMax[i]</code> 是右侧（含自身）最高的柱子高度。水位由两侧较矮的那个决定。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：前缀/后缀最大值数组。</strong> 预计算 <code>leftMax</code> 和 <code>rightMax</code> 数组，然后逐位计算。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：双指针。</strong> 利用一个巧妙的观察——如果 <code>leftMax &lt; rightMax</code>，则当前位置的水位由 <code>leftMax</code> 决定，无需知道精确的 <code>rightMax</code>。因此可以用左右两个指针从两端向中间逼近。</p>\n<p><strong>方法三：单调栈。</strong> 维护一个单调递减栈，当遇到比栈顶大的柱子时，说明形成了一个&quot;凹槽&quot;，可以计算横向积水。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>思维方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前缀/后缀数组</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>纵向逐列计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>纵向逐列，空间优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调栈</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>横向逐层计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>双指针的直觉理解：</strong> 左指针从左往右走，右指针从右往左走。始终移动较矮一侧的指针。如果 <code>height[left] &lt; height[right]</code>，那么 <code>left</code> 位置的水位一定由 <code>leftMax</code> 决定（因为右边至少有一个 <code>height[right]</code> ≥ <code>leftMax</code>），此时可以安全计算 <code>left</code> 位置的积水。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"双指针方法-最优\">双指针方法（最优）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function trap(height: number[]): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = height.length - 1;&#10;  let leftMax = 0;&#10;  let rightMax = 0;&#10;  let water = 0;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt; right) {&#10;    if (height[left] &lt; height[right]) {&#10;      if (height[left] &gt;= leftMax) {&#10;        leftMax = height[left];&#10;      } else {&#10;        water += leftMax - height[left];&#10;      }&#10;      left++;&#10;    } else {&#10;      if (height[right] &gt;= rightMax) {&#10;        rightMax = height[right];&#10;      } else {&#10;        water += rightMax - height[right];&#10;      }&#10;      right--;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return water;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leftMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> water </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (height[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[right]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (height[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leftMax) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        leftMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[left];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        water </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leftMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[left];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (height[right] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightMax) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        rightMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[right];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        water </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[right];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> water;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"单调栈方法\">单调栈方法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function trap(height: number[]): number {&#10;  const stack: number[] = [];&#10;  let water = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; height.length; i++) {&#10;    while (stack.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; height[i] &gt; height[stack[stack.length - 1]]) {&#10;      const bottom = stack.pop()!;&#10;&#10;      if (stack.length === 0) break;&#10;&#10;      const left = stack[stack.length - 1];&#10;      const width = i - left - 1;&#10;      const boundedHeight = Math.min(height[left], height[i]) - height[bottom];&#10;&#10;      water += width * boundedHeight;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    stack.push(i);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return water;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"