n style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bottom</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boundedHeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(height[left], height[i]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height[bottom];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      water </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boundedHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> water;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>双指针法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>leftMax</code> 和 <code>rightMax</code> 分别追踪左右两侧已见过的最大高度。</li>\n<li>每次移动较矮一侧的指针。较矮侧的水位确定性来自于：对面一定存在更高的柱子。</li>\n<li>如果当前高度更新了 <code>max</code>，则该位置无法积水；否则积水量为 <code>max - height[i]</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>单调栈法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>栈中存储下标，保持从栈底到栈顶高度单调递减。</li>\n<li>遇到比栈顶高的柱子时，弹出栈顶作为&quot;凹槽底部&quot;。</li>\n<li>新栈顶和当前柱子是凹槽的左右边界。</li>\n<li>积水量 = 宽度 × 高度差。宽度为 <code>i - left - 1</code>，高度为 <code>min(height[left], height[i]) - height[bottom]</code>。</li>\n<li>这种横向计算方式与纵向逐列计算互补，但结果完全相同。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>双指针</th>\n<th>单调栈</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个元素最多处理两次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>双指针无额外空间，栈最大 n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>双指针更简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>单调栈可推广到二维</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双指针法是面试中的首选：时间 O(n)、空间 O(1)、代码简洁。单调栈法的价值在于其思维模式可以推广到更复杂的问题（如 LC 84 柱状图最大矩形、LC 85 最大矩形等）。</p>\n<p>本题的三种解法分别代表了三种不同的思维范式：前缀/后缀数组代表&quot;预计算&quot;、双指针代表&quot;空间优化&quot;、单调栈代表&quot;维护局部结构&quot;。掌握这三种范式，可以应对大量类似的数组问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 42 接雨水","id":"leetcode-42-接雨水"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"双指针方法（最优）","id":"双指针方法-最优"},{"level":3,"text":"单调栈方法","id":"单调栈方法"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 41 缺失的第一个正数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0041-first-missing-positive"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 76 最小覆盖子串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0076-minimum-window-substring"}}